---
source: crates/warden-schema/tests/parse_errors.rs
description: "definition doc {\n    permission view = (viewer + parent->view & member) - banned\n}"
---
error[E_AMBIGUOUS_OPERATORS]: `+` and `&` cannot be mixed without parentheses
 --> 2:46
  |
2 |     permission view = (viewer + parent->view & member) - banned
  |                                              ^
  |
  = help: add parentheses to say which grouping you mean, either
              (viewer + parent->view) & member
          or
              viewer + (parent->view & member)
